  "description": "V6 5C 刀 B1：四链路 SLO 盘。面板查询全部走 ops/prometheus/ 的 recording 规则（5A 产出口径），不在盘上重新发明公式——盘与规则同源，改口径只改一处。单机单实例口径（docs/operations/SLO.md §6），不是生产 SLA。 口径文档：docs/operations/SLO.md（仓库内）。",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "四条链路（receive/calculate/confirm/refund）的可用性比率，good/(good+bad)，excluded 不进分母。1h 窗用于看「刚才发生了什么」，6h 窗平滑单次抖动。低流量保护：窗口内事件不足时记录规则不产序列（图上空而不是 0）——空窗不是 100% 可用。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "max": 1,
          "min": 0.99,
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.999
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.9995
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "coupon:sli_availability_ratio:1h",
          "legendFormat": "{{journey}} 1h",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "coupon:sli_availability_ratio:6h",
          "legendFormat": "{{journey}} 6h",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "四链路可用性（1h / 6h 窗）",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "28 天错误预算剩余：1=满预算，0=烧完（应冻结非关键发布），负值=超烧。注意本机 Prometheus retention 15d < 28d 时该值是「现有数据的近似」（ops/prometheus/README 边界 1）。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
